      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Doesn't seem like a terrible idea honestly, would definitely help minimize running into children if you were in the normal lobbies.  Lots of minors under 13 want to play the game because they watch their funny youtubers play it, so this would make it possible for them to play and not break TOS.  Given this would need a decent TOS revamp and would need to make sure this wouldn't have a net negative effect with investors.",
